{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgApEWzm2F3ALiZ4mwvGZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2066,"cache_read_input_tokens":22393,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2066},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"07c90268-61c0-494c-ac2f-d653efc58551","uuid":"29f9aba0-06a4-4623-b4f2-8a14d13e2570","timestamp":"2026-10-19T02:34:40.332Z","request_id":"req_011CgApEWi9RvhB6K7Niv4Nc","thinking_duration_ms":1574,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgApEWzm2F3ALiZ4mwvGZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RYBwdKSBT78ntS6NrX6tPi","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > ANSWER.md <<'EOF'\n# Why the nightly review never reported anything\n\nThe job *does* run: `launchctl print` shows `runs = 6` (one per night since\nit was loaded on 2026-10-12) and `last exit code = 1`. Each run left the same\ntwo lines in `Library/Logs/nightly-review.err`:\n\n    Not logged in · Please run /login\n    /Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh:19: read-only variable: status\n\nTwo separate bugs combine to give \"nothing at all\":\n\n## 1. The failure path crashes before it can notify (why you got no failure note)\n\n`nightly-review.zsh` runs under zsh and does `status=$?`. In zsh, `status` is\na read-only special parameter (an alias for `$?`). Assigning to it is a fatal\nerror in a non-interactive script: zsh prints `read-only variable: status`\nand exits with code 1 right there, on line 19. The `if` that calls\n`notify.sh` with \"nightly review FAILED\" is never reached. (This would also\nhave hidden any *success*: every run dies on that line regardless of how\n`claude` exited.)\n\nReproduce: `zsh -c 'false; status=$?; echo after'` → error, no `after`.\n\n**Fix:** rename the variable to `rc`.\n\n## 2. `claude` is not authenticated in the launchd environment (why there was a failure)\n\n`claude -p` exits with `Not logged in · Please run /login`. launchd does not\nstart your login shell, so nothing from `~/.zshrc` / `~/.zprofile` is in the\njob's environment (the plist only sets `PATH`) — e.g. an `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`\nor token you export there isn't visible, and the interactive login's\ncredentials aren't reachable by the headless 02:30 process.\n\n**Fix (needs you, once):** create a long-lived token for unattended use and\ngive it to the job via a private env file that the script now sources:\n\n    claude setup-token                      # prints a token\n    mkdir -p ~/.config/nightly-review\n    printf 'export CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=%s\\n' '<token>' > ~/.config/nightly-review/env\n    chmod 600 ~/.config/nightly-review/env\n\n(Or put `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=...` there if you use an API key.) It's a good idea\nto also add `export TG_BOT_TOKEN=...` there, so `notify.sh` doesn't depend on\nthe keychain being reachable from launchd at 02:30.\n\nThen test without waiting for the night:\n\n    launchctl kickstart -k gui/$UID/com.vk.nightly-review\n    tail ~/Library/Logs/nightly-review.err\n\n## Changes made to `bin/nightly-review.zsh`\n\n- `status` → `rc` (cause 1).\n- Sources `~/.config/nightly-review/env` if present (cause 2).\n- Passes `--allowedTools` for read-only tools (`Read`, `Grep`, `Glob`,\n  `git log/show/diff`): in `-p` mode Claude can't ask for permission, so\n  without this it couldn't run `git log` once logged in.\n- Captures `claude`'s stderr to `$OUT.err` and includes it in the failure\n  message, so a failure note says *why* (e.g. \"Not logged in\").\n- Sends the last 3 lines (the phone summary the prompt asks for at the end)\n  instead of the first 300 bytes.\n\nNo changes needed to the plist or `notify.sh`; nothing was loaded, run, or\nsent anywhere.\nEOF\ngit status --short"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2066,"cache_read_input_tokens":22393,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2066},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"07c90268-61c0-494c-ac2f-d653efc58551","uuid":"8ba86345-53bf-4670-a2ff-61157e646418","timestamp":"2026-10-19T02:34:51.044Z","request_id":"req_011CgApEWi9RvhB6K7Niv4Nc","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01RYBwdKSBT78ntS6NrX6tPi":{"comma